<title>USA: La Jolla starts Phase 2/3 lupus drug trials.</title>
<headline>La Jolla starts Phase 2/3 lupus drug trials.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Jolla Pharmaceuticals said it initiated a Phase II/III clinical trial of LJP 394, its drug candidate for lupus.</p>
<p>The trials will test the safety and efficacy of LJP 394, which is designed to reduce antibodies likned to lupus-related kidney disease.</p>
